meta {
  name: Get Bluesky Analytics
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/analytics/bluesky?days=30
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: DPoP {{oauthAccessToken}}
  DPoP: {{dpopProof}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

docs {
  Authenticated viewer-owned Bluesky analysis, with the same conditional Pro gate as Creator Analytics. Current profile counts, bounded authored-post activity, and top posts published during the selected period. Engagement is current cumulative engagement, not period gains. Searches up to five cached creator article URLs for discovered shares; search coverage is always incomplete. Refresh Creator Analytics first to populate article URLs. Provider failures remain unknown rather than zero.
}
